{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:41 2026-07-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:41 2026-07-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:41 2026-07-17 HKT</p><p>今(17日)早上11時34分，在黃色暴雨警告信號下，薄扶林道92號對開一幅10米乘10米的斜坡有山泥塌下，部分樹木及山泥壓倒泊在路面的電單車停泊處，約7部電單車被壓至翻側，警方及消防接報到場，用生命探測器進行搜索，證實無人被困，無人受傷，並圍封該範圍有待處理。</p><img alt=\"警員圍封受影響範圍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9c4232f24ec16988e97909c7ff7998d4/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_13_07_14_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"山泥塌下壓電單車。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8ce2bae725e390196b379e6de52d50f3/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_13_07_14.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4350841b4bcfae198b555d23f3670e44/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_13_07_13_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方及消防接報到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8a940279b6f7448e0d38dabc832dab24/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_13_07_12.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d2bb5fb7813f30d8511616375a92c46e/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_13_07_11.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7405713de4111318c062b99857cc8a71/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-17_at_13_07_10.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-17T05:58:28.844758+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}